5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I think we need to be practical. I'll look into the state of the car at handover and the trips that repeat weekly to see why things keep falling apart.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I want to know where our time is going. I'll check the hours of use recorded in the diary and the month's trial of recording every run.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"To ensure fairness for everyone, I shall examine last year's tax, insurance and parking papers, as well as the spell of checking each other's figures.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to know why we're getting grumpy with each other. I'll look into what two other car-sharing households said and the weeks of heavy use over the year.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
