12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is often the hidden frictions, the things left unsaid, that weigh most heavily on a friendship. I suspect the answer lies in both the numbers and our hearts.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, I think it's both. The heavy weeks probably stress us out, but I want to see if other people have the same problems so we don't just keep repeating the same mistakes.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I agree with Takumi! We should definitely learn from others so we can be a better team. I'm just excited to see if the fuel receipts match what we thought!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Misaki,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm curious if the diary will show that some of us are doing more of the ""admin"" work than others. It's not just about the driving.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, the labor of coordination is a cost in itself, often invisible until it becomes a burden. We must account for the effort of the mind as well as the coin.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I just hope we can find a way to stop the arguing. If we find out what actually sours these things, we can avoid it.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'll be the one to keep us positive! Once we have all the facts from the papers and the mechanic, we can just figure out a fair way to split everything.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm glad we're all on the same page. Let's just make sure we actually look at these things and don't forget any details before we try to decide on a new system.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,I'll be thorough. I want to know exactly how much of our free time is being eaten up by this car before we commit to another year.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,"I shall approach my research with a steady hand and an open mind, seeking the truth that will allow us to move forward in harmony.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'll do the same. I'm going to find out exactly what goes wrong for other people so we can make sure our new plan actually works.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
