60,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Looking at the options, A seems best for my weekly trips, but C would be fairer for the fuel costs Kenji mentioned. I'm torn between certainty and fairness.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,May,,I'm leaning towards A. A fixed monthly share and set days would completely kill the admin nightmare and the endless evening negotiations. No more recording runs or begging for turns.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option B would place a heavy burden on one person, and C requires the very recording that May found so tedious. I believe Option A offers the most tranquility and stability for our group.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm voting for A too. It stops the ""asking for favors"" problem that other households hated, and we won't have to police each other's figures, which Servas said makes us feel accused.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"I want the fuel to be fair, so C sounds great, but if it makes everyone grumpy and stressed like May said, it's not worth it. I'll vote for A to keep us all friends!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. While C is precise, the peace of mind and the guarantee for my weekly trips make A the most practical choice for everyone.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,May,,"It's settled then. No more spreadsheets, no more endless texting, and no more guilt. Let's just have our days and be done with the stress.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Servas,,"A simple agreement is often the strongest bond. By choosing a path of predictability, we protect our friendship from the erosion of petty disputes.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm glad we're all agreeing. Let's go with A so we can stop worrying about who owes what and just enjoy being friends again.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm in! Let's go with Option A. As long as we all stick to it and keep the car ready for the next person, it'll be awesome!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll cast my vote for Option A. It's the only way to ensure my midweek mornings are predictable and stress-free.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,May,,My vote is for Option A. I'm looking forward to getting my evenings back and ending the coordination chaos.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Servas,,"I cast my vote for Option A. It is the most harmonious path, replacing the friction of accounting with the peace of a shared understanding.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I vote for Option A. Let's stop the favors and the grumpiness and just make it simple.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I vote for Option A! Let's keep things simple and keep our friendship first!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm glad we could reach a consensus so quickly. Let's make sure we set the schedule carefully so everyone's needs are met.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,May,,I'll help organize the calendar. Let's just make sure we're all clear on our days so there's absolutely no need for any more evening-long debates!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Servas,,"May, your enthusiasm for organization is a gift, provided it remains a service to our peace and not a new burden for us to carry.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm just happy we're not fighting anymore. Let's just stick to the plan and keep things easy for everyone.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Kenji,,I'll be the one to remind everyone to fill up the tank on their last day! Let's make this the best car-sharing team ever!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
